roduces more spells, interactions and secrets. \n\nCast creative and diverse spells in a fully interactive world, discovering the many details of a world designed to feel real. Combine arcane ingredients into a boiling cauldron with the help of an ancient spirit trapped in a human skull. Travel to new places, finding yourself in mysterious circumstances full of detail and unforgettable atmosphere.\n\n\nFeature Overview\n\n- Brew magical spells & wield creative powers\n- Defeat guards & dodge traps in a labyrinth\n- Interact with strange artifacts & fun objects\n- Play minigames & collect trophies\n- Travel to new places & experience strange situations\n- Discover easter eggs & surprising details", "short_description": "Feel what it\u2019s like to have magical powers! One of the highest rated PC VR experiences comes to Quest in this remaster of the beloved original. Combine arcane ingredients into a boiling cauldron with the help of an ancient talking skull, unleashing diverse wizardry upon a fully interactive and mysterious world."}]}, "developer_name": "Aldin Dynamics", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.aldin.io/product/privacy-policy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "http://aldindynamics.com/product/wotw-eula.html", "publisher_name": "Aldin Dynamics", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "http://aldin.io/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1990104051447093"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["ADVENTURE", "EXPLORATION", "SIMULATION"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_trackin